---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import { PRODUCTS } from '../config/site';

const name = PRODUCTS.compliance.name;
---

<BaseLayout
  title={name}
  description={`${name} (early access) shows which licences apply to your business, why, and under which Act and section, then keeps them in a register with document packs and renewals.`}
>
  <PageHero
    status={PRODUCTS.compliance.status}
    title={name}
    lead="Know which licences apply to your business, why they apply, and under which Act and section. Then keep them in order with a compliance register, document packs and renewals."
  >
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary">Book a demo</a>
      <a href="/how-it-works/" class="btn-secondary">How it works</a>
    </div>
  </PageHero>

  <Section title="How it works">
    <ol class="space-y-6">
      <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">1. Your business profile</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          You answer questions about your business: what you do, where you operate, your premises, your scale and the number of
          people you employ. You can come back and add detail at any time.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">2. Which licences apply, and why</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          From the profile, {name} lists the licences and registrations that apply. Each item shows the reason it applies and the
          Act and section it comes from. Where facts are missing, it says <strong>“we can’t tell yet”</strong> and tells you what
          it needs — it does not mark the item as “doesn’t apply”.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">3. A compliance register</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          Everything that applies goes into one register: what you hold, what is pending, and what is missing.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">4. Document packs and renewals</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          For each item, a document pack lists what you need to gather. Renewal dates are tracked so you hear about them before
          they fall due. Regulated filings are done by a qualified CA/CS.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Two tracks" tone="muted">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <Card title="Starting a business" href="/starting-a-business/" linkLabel="Starting a business">
        Work out what your new business needs before you open.
      </Card>
      <Card title="Already running" href="/already-running/" linkLabel="Already running">
        Baseline, find gaps, regularise and stay current.
      </Card>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
      Preparing for an inspection? See <a href="/audit-readiness/" class="link">audit readiness</a>.
    </p>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Who it is for">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <Card title="Restaurants & food" href="/industries/restaurants-and-food/" linkLabel="Restaurants & food">
        Food service and food processing businesses.
      </Card>
      <Card title="Manufacturing" href="/industries/manufacturing/" linkLabel="Manufacturing">Manufacturing units and workshops.</Card>
      <Card title="Shops & establishments" href="/industries/shops-and-establishments/" linkLabel="Shops & establishments">
        Shops, offices and other commercial establishments.
      </Card>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section title="What early access means" tone="muted">
    <ul class="max-w-3xl list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
      <li>{name} is being built with a small number of early businesses.</li>
      <li>Coverage starts with Telangana. Other states will follow.</li>
      <li>The rules behind each result are still being written and reviewed, so we will tell you plainly what is covered when we talk.</li>
      <li>Nothing on this website is legal advice. Regulated filings are done by a qualified CA/CS.</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>

  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
